er, call the dismissModalViewControllerAnimated:completion: method of the parent controller responsible for displaying the HVTCameraController object."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To save a still image to the user’s Camera Roll album, call the UIImageWriteToSavedPhotosAlbum function from within the body of the cameraController:didFinishCapturingMediaWithInfo: method. To save a movie to the user’s Camera Roll album, instead call the UISaveVideoAtPathToSavedPhotosAlbum function. These functions, described in UIKit Function Reference, save the image or movie only; they do not save metadata."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To write additional metadata when saving an image to the Camera Roll, use the PHAssetChangeRequest class from the Photos framework. See the description for the HVTCameraControllerMediaMetadata key."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/horizonsdk\/hvtcameracontrollerdelegate"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK"]]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK\/HVTCameraControllerDelegate\/cameraController:didFinishCapturingMediaWithInfo:","doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK\/HVTCameraControllerDelegate\/cameraControllerDidCancel:"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework/documentation/HorizonSDK/HVTCameraControllerDelegate/cameraController:didFinishCapturingMediaWithInfo:":{"url":"\/documentation\/horizonsdk\/hvtcameracontrollerdelegate\/cameracontroller:didfinishcapturingmediawithinfo:","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK\/HVTCameraControllerDelegate\/cameraController:didFinishCapturingMediaWithInfo:"